{"2845840": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Barbotine", "steam_appid": 2845840, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Barbotine is a very short, experimental and linear game designed to be completed in a single sitting (20 - 30 minutes). There is no save system and minimal replay value. It can be played for <strong>FREE</strong> or donated to on itch.io.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Features:</strong></u> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore your progressively distorting apartment across 7 levels and indulge in the increasingly uncanny atmosphere. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845840/extras/5f084d187067d987a5c646392b62b170.poster.avif?t=1784653839\" width=616 height=462 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845840/extras/5f084d187067d987a5c646392b62b170.webm?t=1784653839\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845840/extras/5f084d187067d987a5c646392b62b170.mp4?t=1784653839\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in a tense melee combat system against a peculiar enemy (Easy mode now available in the pause menu!). <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845840/extras/2cfd31cf79b26cfbf52813ec3137e110.poster.avif?t=1784653839\" width=616 height=462 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845840/extras/2cfd31cf79b26cfbf52813ec3137e110.webm?t=1784653839\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845840/extras/2cfd31cf79b26cfbf52813ec3137e110.mp4?t=1784653839\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dig a big hole.  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845840/extras/80203cd70469c0252d04f68d628cff72.poster.avif?t=1784653839\" width=616 height=462 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845840/extras/80203cd70469c0252d04f68d628cff72.webm?t=1784653839\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845840/extras/80203cd70469c0252d04f68d628cff72.mp4?t=1784653839\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Music sampled from freesound. Creator credits:</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soundmatch24, Thehorsevalse, Volvion, Univ_lyon3, Keygenerator, Saintsamael, Doctor_Dreamchip, Arseniiv, Clacksberg, Giouseppe, Tobiasz 'unfa' Karoń, DZeDeNZ, David819</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Barbotine is a very short, experimental and linear game designed to be completed in a single sitting (20 - 30 minutes). There is no save system and minimal replay value. It can be played for <strong>FREE</strong> or donated to on itch.io.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Features:</strong></u> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore your progressively distorting apartment across 7 levels and indulge in the increasingly uncanny atmosphere. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845840/extras/5f084d187067d987a5c646392b62b170.poster.avif?t=1784653839\" width=616 height=462 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845840/extras/5f084d187067d987a5c646392b62b170.webm?t=1784653839\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845840/extras/5f084d187067d987a5c646392b62b170.mp4?t=1784653839\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in a tense melee combat system against a peculiar enemy (Easy mode now available in the pause menu!). <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845840/extras/2cfd31cf79b26cfbf52813ec3137e110.poster.avif?t=1784653839\" width=616 height=462 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845840/extras/2cfd31cf79b26cfbf52813ec3137e110.webm?t=1784653839\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845840/extras/2cfd31cf79b26cfbf52813ec3137e110.mp4?t=1784653839\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dig a big hole.  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845840/extras/80203cd70469c0252d04f68d628cff72.poster.avif?t=1784653839\" width=616 height=462 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845840/extras/80203cd70469c0252d04f68d628cff72.webm?t=1784653839\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845840/extras/80203cd70469c0252d04f68d628cff72.mp4?t=1784653839\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Music sampled from freesound. Creator credits:</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soundmatch24, Thehorsevalse, Volvion, Univ_lyon3, Keygenerator, Saintsamael, Doctor_Dreamchip, Arseniiv, Clacksberg, Giouseppe, Tobiasz 'unfa' Karoń, DZeDeNZ, David819</p>", "short_description": "An atmospheric horror micro-game that touches on topics of anxiety, isolation, body image and obsessive habits with a surreal PSX aesthetic.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845840/header.jpg?t=1784653839", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845840/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784653839", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845840/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1784653839", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10, Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel(R) Core(TM) i5-8250U CPU @ 1.60GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Integrated Graphics<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 200 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> None<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> This is the minimum spec machine the game was tested on, however it is optimized to run well on most low-end systems.</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "developers": ["Alex Rassloff"], "publishers": ["Alex